30 cases; the cascade escalated 5 of them

  policy                          correct  answerable  unanswerable   cost
  cheap model always                19/30       14/18          5/12     6%
  smart model always                18/30       12/18          6/12   100%
  cascade: escalate on refusal      18/30       14/18          4/12    16%
  best of both (no router can)      21/30       14/18          7/12      —

Cost is relative to sending everything to the smart model, at placeholder rates.
A refusal is the only signal here that needs no second model to read, and on the
unanswerable cases it escalates exactly the questions the cheap model got right —
so read that column before believing the cascade's total.
